es-explanation\">\n<p class=\"title\">HIT POLICY priority: selected e</p>\n<ul class=\"tree\">\n<li><div class=\"node rule_not_fired\" style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #5f6368;border-radius:8px\"><div class=\"line\">[ ] a (not fired)</div><div class=\"line\">x &gt; 10 AND NOT y &lt;= 3</div></div>\n<ul>\n<li><div class=\"node connective\" style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #5f6368;border-radius:12px\"><div class=\"line\">all of</div></div>\n<ul>\n<li><div class=\"node truth_false\" style=\"background:#fce8e6;border:1px solid #d93025\"><div class=\"line\">x &gt; 10</div><div class=\"line\">false (x = 8)</div><div class=\"line\">short by 2</div></div></li>\n<li><div class=\"node truth_true\" style=\"background:#e6f4ea;border:1px solid #1e8e3e\"><div class=\"line\">y &lt;= 3</div><div class=\"line\">true (y = 2), but the rule needs it false</div><div class=\"line\">needs y &gt; 3 (short by 1)</div></div></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><div class=\"node rule_not_fired\" style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #5f6368;border-radius:8px\"><div class=\"line\">[ ] b (not fired)</div><div class=\"line\">x BETWEEN 0 AND 5</div></div>\n<ul>\n<li><div class=\"node truth_false\" style=\"background:#fce8e6;border:1px solid #d93025\"><div class=\"line\">x &lt;= 5</div><div class=\"line\">false (x = 8)</div><div class=\"line\">over by 3</div></div></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><div class=\"node rule_not_fired\" style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #5f6368;border-radius:8px\"><div class=\"line\">[ ] c (not fired)</div><div class=\"line\">x &gt; 1 AND NOT x &gt; 1</div><div class=\"line\">cannot fire by changing these conditions alone; they conflict</div></div>\n<ul>\n<li><div class=\"node truth_true\" style=\"background:#e6f4ea;border:1px solid #1e8e3e\"><div class=\"line\">x &gt; 1</div><div class=\"line\">true (x = 8), but the rule needs it false</div><div class=\"line\">needs x &lt;= 1 (over by 7)</div></div></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><div class=\"n